  Title: The Forgotten Toybox
  Subtitle: "CHAPTER EVENT \u2022 LONELINESS"
  StoryText: Half-buried beneath soft wildflowers sits an ornate brass toybox humming
    a gentle lullaby. A rusted clasp guards whatever trinkets sleep inside.
  Illustration: {fileID: 1033468905, guid: 3ef97e551d654ba47b3b4393e27ba5e9, type: 3}
  Choices:
  - Label: Pry Open the Clasp
    OutcomePreview: "[Lose 6 HP \u2022 Gain Random Relic]"
    ResultStory: The sharp latch nicks your fingers, yet nestled inside the velvet
      lining glows a forgotten relic!
    RequiredMinGold: 0
    RequiredMinHealth: 6
    GoldDelta: 0
    HealthDelta: -6
    MaxHealthDelta: 0
    StressDelta: 0
    GrantRandomRelic: 1
    GrantRandomCard: 0
  - Label: Wind the Music Box
    OutcomePreview: "[Restore +25 Will \u2022 Gain 35g]"
    ResultStory: A familiar melody drifts into the breeze, steadying your heart while
      a handful of coins tumbles from the base.
    RequiredMinGold: 0
    RequiredMinHealth: 0
    GoldDelta: 35
    HealthDelta: 0
    MaxHealthDelta: 0
    StressDelta: -25
    GrantRandomRelic: 0
    GrantRandomCard: 0
  - Label: Leave It Undisturbed
    OutcomePreview: '[Heal 8 HP]'
    ResultStory: You take a quiet breath beside the flowers before continuing down
      the path.
    RequiredMinGold: 0
    RequiredMinHealth: 0
    GoldDelta: 0
    HealthDelta: 8
    MaxHealthDelta: 0
    StressDelta: 0
    GrantRandomRelic: 0
    GrantRandomCard: 0
